DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261201T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261201T190000
SUMMARY:Bob TV Episode 4: Why Generic AI Fails at Mainframe Scale
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:IBM’s Ethan Mendel explains why general-purpose AI models bec
 ome unreliable on mainframe-scale codebases\, and how static code analysis
  combined with metadata-enriched models makes AI dependable for modernisat
 ion work.\n\nOrganiser: IBM Switzerland (Data\, Cloud and AI in Switzerlan
 d)\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/bob-tv-e
 pisode-4-mainframe-ai-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/bob-tv-episode-4-mainframe-ai-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
