DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261216T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261216T183000
SUMMARY:Webinar: Wie funktioniert ein Quantencomputer?
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:Quantum optics researcher Wolfgang Geist gives a jargon-free in
 troduction to quantum computing — superposition\, entanglement and measu
 rement\, illustrated by quantum teleportation — and sorts out where it g
 enuinely connects to AI and where that is still research.\n\nOrganiser: Ve
 rein Smartfeld\, St. Gallen\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdata
 events.ch/events/smartfeld-webinar-quantencomputer-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/smartfeld-webinar-quantencomputer-202
 6/
